<title>UK: Bulker to complete transhipment of sugar April 16.</title>
<headline>Bulker to complete transhipment of sugar April 16.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cypriot-flag bulk carrier Theodoros S. will complete transhipment of its cargo of 20,000 tonnes of raw sugar on Wednesday, April 16, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>After the cargo has been removed, the 27,023-dwt vessel will proceed to a repair yard over the next few days.</p>
<p>Theodoros S. was holed in mid-March when it was involved in a collision with the 33,423-dwt Turkish-registered Gulsum Ana off Malaga, Spain.</p>
